<title>ITALY: Reno di Medici,Saffa study merger.</title>
<headline>Reno di Medici,Saffa study merger.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Italian companies Reno di Medici and Saffa were suspended on Monday on the Milan bourse as the two groups said in a statement that they were studying a merger.</p>
</text>
